    ("S2  DV = AEHS clinical scale (0 / 1-2 / 3-4 / 5-7)", "Y_aeHS", dict(), dict()),
    ("S3  DV = strict COVID-only AE, 3 levels", "Y3_c19", dict(), dict()),
